  const KNOWLEDGE = [{"fact":"Get focuses on obtaining or receiving something; have focuses on possessing or experiencing it.","es":"Get se centra en obtener o recibir algo; have se centra en poseerlo o experimentarlo.","answer":"Get","icon":"📦"},{"fact":"Do performs a task or activity; make creates or produces something.","es":"Do realiza una tarea o actividad; make crea o produce algo.","answer":"Do","icon":"✅"},{"fact":"Put on places clothes on your body; take off removes them.","es":"Put on coloca la ropa en el cuerpo; take off la quita.","answer":"Take off","icon":"🧥"},{"fact":"Wake means stop sleeping; sleep means remain in the sleeping state.","es":"Wake significa dejar de dormir; sleep significa permanecer dormido.","answer":"Wake","icon":"⏰"},{"fact":"Rest helps you recover energy; relax focuses on becoming calm and less tense.","es":"Rest ayuda a recuperar energía; relax se centra en calmarse y reducir la tensión.","answer":"Relax","icon":"🛋️"},{"fact":"Prepare makes something ready; serve gives food, drink or a service to someone.","es":"Prepare deja algo listo; serve entrega comida, bebida o un servicio a alguien.","answer":"Serve","icon":"🍽️"},{"fact":"Eat out means have a meal away from home, usually in a restaurant.","es":"Eat out significa comer fuera de casa, normalmente en un restaurante.","answer":"Eat out","icon":"🍴"},{"fact":"Shop describes the activity of looking for and buying things; buy focuses on the purchase itself.","es":"Shop describe la actividad de buscar y comprar cosas; buy se centra en la compra.","answer":"Shop","icon":"🛍️"},{"fact":"Pack puts things into luggage or a box; unpack takes them out.","es":"Pack mete cosas en una maleta o caja; unpack las saca.","answer":"Unpack","icon":"🧳"},{"fact":"Carry on and continue are close in meaning; carry on is a multi-word verbal unit.","es":"Carry on y continue tienen significados cercanos; carry on es una unidad verbal de varias palabras.","answer":"Carry on","icon":"➡️"},{"fact":"Turn on activates a device; turn off deactivates it.","es":"Turn on activa un dispositivo; turn off lo desactiva.","answer":"Turn off","icon":"💡"},{"fact":"Lock secures something; unlock removes that security so it can open.","es":"Lock asegura algo; unlock elimina esa seguridad para poder abrirlo.","answer":"Unlock","icon":"🔐"},{"fact":"Repair and fix are close in meaning; repair is the new Theme 13 target.","es":"Repair y fix tienen significados cercanos; repair es el nuevo target del Theme 13.","answer":"Repair","icon":"🛠️"},{"fact":"Build joins parts or materials to create a structure; make is more general.","es":"Build une partes o materiales para crear una estructura; make es más general.","answer":"Build","icon":"🧱"},{"fact":"Move in means begin living in a home; move out means leave it as your home.","es":"Move in significa empezar a vivir en una casa; move out significa dejarla como hogar.","answer":"Move out","icon":"🏠"},{"fact":"Borrow means receive something temporarily; lend means give it temporarily.","es":"Borrow significa recibir algo temporalmente; lend significa darlo temporalmente.","answer":"Lend","icon":"🤝"},{"fact":"Own means possess something; belong describes who or what it is connected to or owned by.","es":"Own significa poseer algo; belong describe a quién pertenece o con qué grupo se relaciona.","answer":"Belong","icon":"🏷️"},{"fact":"Search is the activity of looking carefully; find is the successful result.","es":"Search es la actividad de buscar cuidadosamente; find es el resultado exitoso.","answer":"Search","icon":"🔎"},{"fact":"Reach focuses on arriving at a point or extending far enough; arrive focuses on getting to a place.","es":"Reach se centra en alcanzar un punto o extenderse lo suficiente; arrive en llegar a un lugar.","answer":"Reach","icon":"🎯"},{"fact":"Carry out means perform and complete a task, plan or instruction.","es":"Carry out significa realizar y completar una tarea, plan o instrucción.","answer":"Carry out","icon":"📋"}];

